<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 234)</h2>
<p><b>Important fix: Kitsu and AAF now actually work in the installed app.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The bundled Kitsu provider and AAF converter failed to launch in every notarized build to date — a code-signing mismatch that only appeared in the shipped app, never on the development machine. Both are rebuilt correctly; Review List from Kitsu, Publish to Kitsu, and AAF conform now work everywhere, not just where they were written.</li>
<li>If a Kitsu pull or AAF import silently did nothing for you before: this was why. Please update and try again.</li>
<li>Includes everything from build 232: the watch folder asks Kitsu whether a delivery's version is already tracked and ingests immediately on confirmation, with the task attached for publishing back.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
